title: "Goldfinger: GRAND SLAM — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  PROJECT BOND film package modelling Goldfinger (1964) as six deterministic,
  fully-tested scientific modules across three attack surfaces — gold-market
  cornering and a first-generation speculative attack on the gold peg; layered
  and network vault defense; scalar and thermal laser threat physics — exposed
  via the frozen BOND-API MissionProvider protocol.
